{
 "uid": "guardrail-live",
 "title": "Guardrail chain - live traffic",
 "tags": [
  "kong",
  "guardrail",
  "ai",
  "live"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 2,
 "editable": true,
 "refresh": "10s",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-20m",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "templating": {
  "list": [
   {
    "name": "route",
    "label": "Route",
    "type": "query",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "go-prom"
    },
    "query": {
     "query": "label_values(go_live_requests, route)",
     "refId": "v"
    },
    "definition": "label_values(go_live_requests, route)",
    "includeAll": true,
    "multi": true,
    "refresh": 2,
    "sort": 1,
    "allValue": ".*",
    "current": {
     "selected": true,
     "text": [
      "All"
     ],
     "value": [
      "$__all"
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "name": "guardrail",
    "label": "Guardrail",
    "type": "query",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "go-prom"
    },
    "query": {
     "query": "label_values(go_live_guardrail_reached, guardrail)",
     "refId": "v"
    },
    "definition": "label_values(go_live_guardrail_reached, guardrail)",
    "includeAll": true,
    "multi": true,
    "refresh": 2,
    "sort": 1,
    "allValue": ".*",
    "current": {
     "selected": true,
     "text": [
      "All"
     ],
     "value": [
      "$__all"
     ]
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 10
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### How to read this\n\n**Signals, not verdicts.** Ordinary traffic has no answer key, so nothing here proves a guardrail right\nor wrong. Every number is a place to look.\n\n| You see | It means | Look at |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Stopped in gateway** rises | More requests end inside Kong | Attack wave, or a guardrail overcatching |\n| **Suspected fail-open** above 0 | A guardrail took about its timeout, then let the request through | That guardrail's backend |\n| **Flagged but served** above 0 | It detected a problem and the client still got the answer | Is it in detect-only mode on purpose? |\n| **Ran without a decision** | The guardrail ran but recorded no allow or block | Errors, or no adapter for it |\n| **Coverage findings** | An AI route with no guardrail, or one its sibling routes have | Route config |\n| **Retry got through** | Caller was blocked, rephrased, and passed | Overcatch (honest caller) or a slip (attacker) |\n\nHover the **(i)** on any panel for what it measures. Values are recomputed over a sliding window.\n"
   },
   "transparent": true
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "row",
   "title": "At a glance",
   "collapsed": false,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 10,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 1
   },
   "panels": []
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Requests in window",
   "description": "Requests the evaluator has seen on the selected routes inside the sliding window.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "go-prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 11,
    "w": 6,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum(go_live_requests{route=~\"$route\"})",
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none",
     "noValue": "0",
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#5b9cf5",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ]
    },
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "area",
    "textMode": "value",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Stopped in the gateway",
   "description": "Share of requests that ended inside Kong, whichever plugin ended them. Amber from 20%, red from 40%.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "go-prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 6,
    "y": 11,
    "w": 6,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum(go_live_route_blocked{route=~\"$route\"}) / sum(go_live_requests{route=~\"$route\"})",
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "percentunit",
     "noValue": "0",
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#3fb68b",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "#f2a93b",
        "value": 0.2
       },
       {
        "color": "#e5484d",
        "value": 0.4
       }
